The degradation traces to one root cause: `ts-order-other-service` has slow database calls. Its slowness reaches users through two paths, `ts-admin-order-service` and `ts-security-service` → `ts-preserve-service`. I found no restarts, CPU or memory saturation, or connection-pool changes that would point to another fault.

